== users (paged) ==
items alice:AID1 bob:AID2 carol:AID3
markers -,m2
== roles ==
items app:RID1
== policies ==
items ReadOnly:PID1
== user inline policies ==
names inline-a inline-b
call ListUserPolicies UserName=bob
== user attached policies ==
attached AmazonS3ReadOnlyAccess=arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonS3ReadOnlyAccess
call ListAttachedUserPolicies UserName=bob
== role inline policies ==
names role-inline
call ListRolePolicies RoleName=app
